{% doc %}
  The ordered list of the store's home collections, from the theme setting
  "Home collections, in order" (config/settings_schema.json holds the default).
  This is the ONE place the list is read (PRD R8); callers capture the output
  and split it:
    capture category_handles_raw
      render 'collection-handles'
    endcapture
    assign category_handles = category_handles_raw | strip | split: ','
  Output: comma-separated handles with no spaces, e.g. pet-cleaning,pet-toys
{% enddoc %}
{{- settings.home_collection_handles | remove: ' ' -}}
